      "id": "claim_fb3758bd894c46b4b8281471f097507b",
      "statement": "Confirm tokens for MCP manage writes live only in process memory with a 300-second TTL, are consumed exactly once, and are bound to the action string that created them, so a restart silently invalidates outstanding confirmations without any persisted cleanup.",
