      "statement": "API keys are generated as 64-character hex, stored as a bcrypt hash for verification plus an 8-character prefix for lookup, and additionally Fernet-encrypted with a key derived from SHA-256 of API_KEY_SECRET — which raises RuntimeError at import time if the variable is unset.",
